  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of IntraDotNet.CleanArchitecture.Infrastructure.EFCore\n      - AuditableDbContext with automatic audit field population (CreatedBy, UpdatedBy, DeletedBy)\n      - Automatic soft delete support (converts Delete to Modified)\n      - GuidRepository and IntRepository implementations\n      - Unit of Work implementation with transaction support\n      - ICurrentUserService integration for user context\n      - Support for optimistic concurrency with IRowVersion",
